@startuml
title E1 - Podvojena oddaja povratne informacije

actor "Uporabnik" as User
boundary "PovratnaInfoMaska" as UI
control "PovratneInfoKontroler" as Controller
entity "PovratneInformacije" as Feedback

Sistem -> User: prikaže poziv za oddajo

User -> UI: odpre obrazec
activate UI

User -> UI: vnese oceno in komentar
User -> UI: odda obrazec

UI -> Controller: oddajPovratnoInfo(..., ocena, komentar, jwt)
activate Controller

Controller -> Feedback: preveriŽeOddano(...)
activate Feedback
Feedback --> Controller: niOddano = ne
deactivate Feedback

Controller --> UI: napaka (že oddano)
deactivate Controller

UI --> User: obvestilo o obstoječi oddaji

User -> UI: zapre obrazec ali izbere drug dogodek

deactivate UI
@enduml